---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Corrections from "../../components/Corrections";
---

<Base title="Corrections">
  <main>
    <h1>Send a correction</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      If an alert misreads a record, names the wrong place or is out of date, tell us. You do not
      need an account. An administrator reads every correction.
    </p>
    <Corrections client:only="preact" />
    <h2>What happens next</h2>
    <p>
      An administrator checks your correction against the record. If the alert is wrong it is
      fixed or taken down. An alert comes down whenever a reviewer's confirmation is reversed.
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
